---
title: "A layer cake"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> board
  board: the cake board
  base: the bottom sponge
  jam: raspberry jam
  middle: the middle sponge
  cream: whipped cream
  top: the top sponge
  iced: the icing
  board --> base: add a layer
  base --> base: wait to set [still soft]
  base --> jam: add a layer [layer below is set]
  jam --> jam: wait to set [still soft]
  jam --> middle: add a layer [layer below is set]
  middle --> middle: wait to set [still soft]
  middle --> cream: add a layer [layer below is set]
  cream --> cream: wait to set [still soft]
  cream --> top: add a layer [layer below is set]
  top --> top: wait to set [still soft]
  top --> iced: ice it [top is set]
  iced --> board: start again
